## Scope of the Research Claims

This work is an **exploratory and associational** analysis of Morocco's
freshwater trajectory between 2000 and 2025. It is explicitly **not**
designed to establish causal attribution. Conclusions should be read as
hypothesis-generating rather than confirmatory.

The manuscript reports an OLS model with an R-squared of 0.812 on a model
sample of n = 16. These results are conditional on the specific indicator
definitions, time window, and model specification documented in the
manuscript. Reuse of the code does not imply endorsement of the empirical
findings by the author.

